BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:serifos-platys-gialos-panigiri-of-agioi-apostoloi-platys-gialos-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270628
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270630
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agioi Apostoloi\, Platys Gialos
LOCATION:Platys Gialos\, Serifos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The first big feast of the Serifos summer\, at the chapel of Peter and Paul by the beach of Platys Gialos in the north: vespers on the evening of 28 June\, a communal meal put on by the ktitores (the families who keep the church) — fava\, goat with pasta\, local wine — then liturgy and more food next morning. The road from Chora is partly unpaved and the bay has no lighting\, so drive carefully and bring a torch.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/serifos/#platys-gialos-panigiri-of-agioi-apostoloi-platys-gialos
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/serifos/#platys-gialos-panigiri-of-agioi-apostoloi-platys-gialos
END:VEVENT
